1
00:00:00,323 --> 00:00:02,613
(Sheldon:)...of gamma rays
from dark-matter annihilations.

2
00:00:02,784 --> 00:00:04,954
(Sheldon:)-It occurred to me that I could--
-Excuse me.

3
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:08,160
(Leonard:)How many reels before the subordinate
male protagonist gets to his point?

4
00:00:08,331 --> 00:00:12,631
(Sheldon:)If you didn't cheer at my entrance,
it's too late to buy into the premise.

5
00:00:14,921 --> 00:00:18,261
(Sheldon:)Anyway, I got some extra money
from the head of the department...

6
00:00:18,425 --> 00:00:21,095
(Sheldon:)...and Raj can come work for me.

7
00:00:21,636 --> 00:00:23,096
(Raj:)You want me to work with you?

8
00:00:24,097 --> 00:00:25,847
(Sheldon:)For me.

9
00:00:26,182 --> 00:00:29,642
(Sheldon:)You're going to have to listen
more carefully when you're on the job.

10
00:00:29,978 --> 00:00:32,148
Okay. Please don't take this
the wrong way...

11
00:00:32,314 --> 00:00:35,274
...but I'd rather swim buck naked
across the Ganges...

12
00:00:35,442 --> 00:00:37,442
(Raj:)...with a paper cut on my nipple...

13
00:00:37,611 --> 00:00:40,821
(Raj:)...and die a slow, agonizing death
from a viral infection...

14
00:00:40,989 --> 00:00:42,779
(Raj:)...than work with you.

15
00:00:44,159 --> 00:00:46,119
(Sheldon:)For me.

16
00:00:53,710 --> 00:00:54,750
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

17
00:00:56,087 --> 00:00:57,257
(Raj(knocking and entering):)Sheldon, are you busy?

18
00:00:57,922 --> 00:01:00,302
(Sheldon:)Of course I'm busy.

